.TH AETERNUS 1 "2026-11-15" "aeternus 1.4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
aeternus \- GPU-accelerated terminal emulator
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aeternus
[\fB\-c\fR \fIpath\fR]
[\fB\-\-bench\fR]
[\fB\-h\fR]
[\fB\-V\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B aeternus
is a terminal emulator for Linux rendered on the GPU with wgpu. It runs on Wayland and X11,
supports tabs, truecolor, wide characters, color emoji, combining marks, OSC 8 hyperlinks,
clickable URLs and an optional cursor trail animation.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-config " " \fIpath\fR
Use \fIpath\fR as the configuration file instead of the default one.
.TP
.B \-\-bench
Run the built-in parser benchmark and exit.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print a short help and exit.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH CONFIGURATION
The configuration lives in
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/aeternus/config.toml
(usually
.IR ~/.config/aeternus/config.toml ).
A commented template is written on first run. The file is reloaded automatically when it changes;
on errors the previous configuration is kept and the error is logged.
Colors use kitty's names (\fBforeground\fR, \fBbackground\fR, \fBcolor0\fR to \fBcolor255\fR...) and \fBtheme\fR in \fB[colors]\fR loads a kitty theme file.
Background transparency is set with \fBopacity\fR in \fB[window]\fR (0.0 to 1.0).
Sections: \fB[font]\fR, \fB[window]\fR, \fB[terminal]\fR, \fB[cursor]\fR, \fB[bell]\fR,
\fB[colors]\fR and \fB[keybindings]\fR.
.SH KEYBINDINGS
Defaults, all configurable in \fB[keybindings]\fR (an empty list disables an action):
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+C / Ctrl+Shift+V
Copy / paste.
.TP
.B Shift+Insert
Paste the primary selection.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+T / Ctrl+Shift+W
New tab / close tab.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Tab, Ctrl+PageDown / Ctrl+Shift+Tab, Ctrl+PageUp
Next / previous tab.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+= / Ctrl+Shift+\- / Ctrl+Shift+0
Zoom in / out / reset (also Ctrl+mouse wheel).
.TP
.B Shift+PageUp / Shift+PageDown / Shift+Home / Shift+End
Scroll the history.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+F
Search the scrollback. Enter or Up goes to the previous match, Shift+Enter or Down to the next,
Ctrl+Backspace clears the query and Esc closes the search bar.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+R
Reload the configuration.
.TP
.B F11
Toggle fullscreen.
.TP
.B Ctrl+click
Open the URL or hyperlink under the mouse (Ctrl+Shift+click when the program captures the mouse).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/aeternus/config.toml
Configuration file.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/aeternus/aeternus.log
Log file with errors and warnings.
.TP
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/aeternus-*.sock
Control sockets used by
.BR aet (1).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
The shell is started with \fBTERM=xterm-256color\fR, \fBCOLORTERM=truecolor\fR,
\fBTERM_PROGRAM=aeternus\fR and \fBTERM_PROGRAM_VERSION\fR set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR aet (1)
.SH BUGS
https://github.com/AeternalAngel/aeternus/issues
